  "own_original_text": "Executive Order 12397 of December 23, 1982\nNational Commission on Social Security Reform\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and laws of the  \nUnited States of America, and specifically the Federal Advisory Committee  \nAct, as amended (5 U.S.C. App. I), it is hereby ordered that Section 2(b) of  \nExecutive Order No. 12335, establishing the National Commission on Social  \nSecurity Reform, is hereby amended to provide as follows:\n“The Commission shall make its report to the President by January 15,1983.’’.\nTHE WHITE HOUSE,  \nD e cem b e r 23, 1982.\n[F R  Doc. 82-35230 \nFiled 12-23-82; 1 :21 pm ]",
